{
  "title": "Dua e Sad Subhan (Dua e Sahifa)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nسُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ الْعَظِیْمِ وَ بِحَمْدِهٖ \nSUBHAANALLAAHIL A’ZEEME WA BE HAMDEHI. \nGlory be to Allah, the Supreme! Praise be to He!\nسُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مَلِيكٍ مَّا اَقْدَرَهٗ \nSUBHAANAHU MIN ELAAHIM MAA-A’QDARAHU. \nGlory be to He in (His) Divinity! How omnipotent He is!\nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ قَدِیْرٍ مَّا اَعْظَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN QADEERIM MA-AKHZAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) omnipotence! How powerful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَظِیْمٍ مَّآ اَجَلَّهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN A’ZEEMIN MAA-AJALLAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) power! How mighty He is!\nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ جَلِیْلٍ مَّا اَمْجَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAU MIN JALEELIM MAA AMJADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) might! How eminent He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مَّاجِدٍ مَّآ اَرْاَفَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MAAJEDIM MAA AR-AFAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) eminence! How compassionate He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ رَّءُوْفٍ مَّا اَعَزَّهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN RA-OOFIM MAA A-A’ZZAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) compassion! How powerful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَزِیْزٍ مَّا اَكْبَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAU MIN A’ZEEZIM MAA AKBARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) power! How majestic He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ كَبِیْرٍ مَّا اَقْدَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KABEERIM MAA-AQDAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (his) majesty! How eternal He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ قَدِیْمٍ مَّا اَعْلَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN QADEEMIN MAA-A-A’LAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) eternity! How high He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَلِيٍّ مَا اَسْنَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN A’LIYYIM MAA ASNAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) highness! How sublime He is!\nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ سَنِیٍّ مَّا اَبْھَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SANIYYIM MAA ABHAAHO\nGlory be to He in (His) sublimity! How beautiful! He is!\nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ بَھِیْءٍ مَّا اَنْوَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN BAHIHIM MAA AWWARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) beauty! How resplendent He is!\nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُّنِیْرٍ مَّآ اَظْھَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MONEERIM MAA AZHARAHU\nGlory be to He in (His) splendour! How manifest He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ ظَاھِرٍ مَّا اَخْفَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN ZAAHERIM MAA AKHFAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) manifestation! How secret He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ خَفِیٍّ مَّا اَعْلَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KHAFIYIM MAA A-A’LAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) secrecy! How intelligent He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَلِیْمٍ مَّا اَخْبَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN A’LIMIM MAA AKHBARAHU \nGlory be to He in (his intelligence! How aware He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ خَبِیْرٍ مَّا اَكْرَمَهٗ\nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KHABEERIM MAA AKRAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) awareness! How generous He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ كَرِيْمٍ مَّا اَلْطَفَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KAREEMIM MAA ALTAFAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) generosity! How kind He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ لَطِیْفٍ مَّا اَبْصَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN LATEEFIM MAA ABSARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) kindness! How sagacious He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ بَصِیْرٍ مَّا اَسْمَعَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN BASEERIM MAA ASMA-A’HU \nGlory be to He in (His) sagaciousness! How attentive He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ سَمِیْعٍ مَّا اَحْفَظَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SAMEE-I’M MAA AHFAZAHU \nGlory be to be in (His) attendancy! How watchful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ حَفِیْظٍ مَّا اَمْلَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN HAFEEZIM MAA AMLAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) watchfulness! How persuasive He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مَّلِیٍّ مَّا اَوْفَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MALIYYIM MAA AWFAAHO\nGlory be to He in (His) pervasion! How complete He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ وَفِیٍّ مَّا اَغْنَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN WAFIYYIM MAA AGHNAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) completeness! How sufficient He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ غَنِیٍّ مَّا اَعْطَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN GHANIYYIM MAA A-A’TAAHO\nGlory be to He in (His) sufficiency! How liberal He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُّعْطٍ مَّا اَوْسَعَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MO’TIM MAA AWSA-A’HU \nGlory be to He in (His) liberality! How bountiful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ وَّاسِعٍ مَّا اَجْوَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN WAASE-I’M MAA AJWADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) bountifulness! How plenteous He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن جَوَادٍ مَّا اَفْضَلَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN JAWAADIM MAA AFZALAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) plenteousness! How superb He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن مُّفْضِلٍ مَّا اَنْعَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MOFAZZELIM MAA AN-A’MAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) superbness! How charitable He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن مُّنْعِمٍ مَّا اَسْیَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MAN-A’ MIMMAA ASYADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) charitableness! How masterful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ سَیِّدٍ مَّا اَرْحَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SAYYEDIM MAA ARHAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) masterdom! How Merciful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن رَحِیْمٍ مَّا اَشَدَّهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN RAHEEMIM MAA ASHADDOHU \nGlory be to He in (His) mercifulness! How resoulute He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ شَدِیْدٍ مَّا اَقْوَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SHADEEDIM MAA AQWAAHO\nGlory be to He in (His) resoluteness! How strong He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن قَوِیٍّ مَّا اَحْمَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN QAWIYYIM MAA AHMADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) strength! How praiseworthy He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ حَمِیْدٍ مَّا اَحْكَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN HAMEEDIM MAA AHKAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) praiseworthiness, How wise He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن حَكِیْمٍ مَّا اَبْطَشَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN HAKEEMIM MAA ABTASHAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) wisdom! How confident He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن بَاطِشٍ مَّا اَقْوَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN BAATESHIM MAA AQWAMAHU\nGlory be to He in (His) confidence! How durable He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ قَيُّوْمٍ مَا اَدْوَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN QAYYOOMIM MAA ADWAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) durability! How everlasting He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ دَآئِمٍ مَّا اَبْقَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN DAAA-EMIM MAA ABQAAHO\nGlory be to He in (His) everlastingness! How perpetual He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن بَاقٍ مَّا اَفْرَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN BAAQIM MAA AFRADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) perpetuality! How unique He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن فَرْدٍ مَّا اَوْحَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN FARDIM MAA AW-HADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) uniqueness! How singular He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن وَّاحِدٍ مَّا اَصْمَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN WAAHEDIM MAA ASMADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) singularity! How independent He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ صَمَدٍ مَّا اَمْلَكَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SAMADIM MAA AMLAKAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) independence! How sovereign He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مَّالِكٍ مَّا اَوْلَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MOLEKIM MAA AWLAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) sovereignty! How authoritative He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن وَّلِیٍّ مَّا اَعْظَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN WALIYYIM MAA A-A’ZAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) authority! How great He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَظِیْمٍ مَّا اَكْمَلَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN A’ZEEMIM MAA AKMALAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) greatness! How perfect He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن كَامِلٍ مَّا اَتَمَّهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KAAMELIM MAA ATAMMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) perfectness! How thorough He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ تَآمٍّ مَّآ اَعْجَبَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN TAAAM-MIM MAA A’J-MAHU \nGlory be to He in (his) thoroughness! How marvellous He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَجِیْبٍ مَّا اَفْخَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN A’JEEBIM MAA AFKHARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) marvelousness! How proud He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ فَاخِرٍ مَّا اَبْعَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN FAAKHERIM MAA AB-A’DAHU \nGlory be to hew in (His) pride! How remote He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ بَعِیْدٍ مَّا اَقْرَبَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN BA-E’EDIM MAA AQRABAHU \nGlory be to He is remoteness! How near He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن قَرِیْبٍ مَّا اَمْنَعَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KAREEBIM MAA AMNA-AHU \nGlory be to He in (His) nearness! How inaccessible He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن مَّانِعٍ مَّا اَغْلَبَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MAAA-NE-I’M MAA AGHLABAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) inaccessibility! How victorious He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ غَالِبٍ مَّا اَعْفَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN GHAALEBIM MAA A-A’KAAHU \nGlory be to (His) victoriousness! How tolerant He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَفُوٍّ مَّا اَحْسَنَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN AKUWWIM MAA AHSANAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) toleration! How indulgent He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُحْسِنٍ مَّا اَجْمَلَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MOHSENIM MAA AJMALAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) indulgence! How adorable He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ جَمِيْلٍ مَّا اَقْبَلَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN JAMEELIN MAA AQBALAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) adorableness! How obliging He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ قَابِلٍ مَّا اَشْكَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN QAABELIM MAA ASHKARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) obligingness! How thankworthy He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن شَكُوْرٍ مَّا اَغْفَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SHAKOORIM MAA AGHFARAHU \nGlory be to He in His thank worthiness! How Oft-forgiving He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ غَفُوْرٍ مَّا اَصْبَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN GHAFOORIM MAA ASBARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) oft-forgiveness! How patient He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ صَبُوْرٍ مَا اَجْبَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SABOORIM MAA AJBARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) patience! How effective He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ جَبَّارٍ مَّا اَدْیَنَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN JABBAARIM MAA ADYANAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) effectiveness! How judicious He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ دَیَّانٍ مَّا اَقْضَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN DAYYAANIM MAA A’KZAAHO\nGlory be to He in (His) judiciousness! How decisive He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ قَاضٍ مَّا اَمْضَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KAAZIM MAA AMZAAHO \nGlory be to He in (His) decisiveness! How alert He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مَّاضٍ مَّا اَنْفَذَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MAAZIM MAA ANFAZAHU\nGlory be to He in (His) alertness! How executive He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ نَافِذٍ مَّا اَرْحَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN NAAFEZIM MAA AHLAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) execution! How gentle He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ رَحِیْمٍ مَّا اَخْلَقَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN HALEEMIM MAA AKHLAQAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) gentleness! How refined He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن خَالِقٍ مَا اَرْزَقَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KHAALEKIM MAA ARZAQAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) refinement! How sustaining He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ رَازِقٍ مَا اَقْھَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN RAAZEKIM MAA AQHARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) sustainment! How forceful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن قَاھِرٍ مَا اَنْشَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN QAAHERIM MAA ANSHAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) forcibleness! How creative He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُّنْشِءٍ مَا اَمْلَكَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MUNSHE-IM MAA AMLAKAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) creativeness! How kingly He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مَالِكٍ مَا اَوْلَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MAALEKIM MAA AWLAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) kingdom! How lordly He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ وَالٍ مَا اَرْفَعَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN WAALIM MAA AR-FA-A’HU \nGlory be to He in (His) lordliness! How lofty He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ رَفِیْعٍ مَّا اَشْرَفَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN RAFEE-I’M MAA ASHRAFAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) loftiness! How dominant He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ شَرِیْفٍ مَّا اَبْسَطَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SHAREEFIM MAA ABSATAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) dominancy! How extensive He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهُ مِنْ بَاسِطٍ مَا أَقْبَضَهٗ\nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN BAASETIM MAA A’KBAZAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) extensiveness! How appropriative He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ قَابِضٍ مَّا اَبْدَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN QAABEZIM MAA AB-DAAHO \nGlory be to He in (His) appropriativenes! How originative He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِن بَّادٍ مَّا اَقْدَسَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN BAADIM MAA A’KDASAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) origination! How holy He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ قُدُّوْسٍ مَّا اَطْھَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN QUDDOOSIM MAA AZHARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) holiness! How pure He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ طَاھِرٍ مَّا اَزْكَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN TAAHERIM MAA AZKAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) purity! How pious He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ زَكِیٍّ مَّا اَهْدَاهُ\nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN ZAKIYYIM MAA AHDAAHO\nGlory be to He in (His) piety! How guiding He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ هَادٍ مَا اَصْدَقَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN HAADIM MAA ASDAKAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) guidance! How truthful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ صَادِقٍ مَّا اَعْوَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SAADEKIM MAA A-A’WADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) truthfulness! How timeless He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَوَّادٍ مَّا اَفْطَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN AWWAADIM MAA AFTARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) timelessness! How intentive He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ فَاطِرٍ مَّا اَرْعَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN FAATERIM MAA AR-A’AHU \nGlory be to He in (His) inventiveness! How protecting He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ رَاعٍ مَّا اَعْوَنَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN RAA-I’M MAA A-A’WANAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) protectorship! How supporting He! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُّعِیْنٍ مَّا اَوْھَبَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MO-E’ENIM MAA AWHABAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) supportment! How benevolent He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ وَھَّابٍ مَّا اَتْوَبَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN WAHHAABIM MAA ATWABAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) benevolence! How accommodative He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ تَوَّابٍ مَّا اَسْخَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN TAWWAABIM MAA ASKHAAHO \nGlory be to He in (His) accommodativeness! How munificent He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ سَخْیٍ مَّا اَنْصَرَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SAKHIYYIM MAA ANSARAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) munificence! How helpful He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ نَصِیْرٍمَّا اَسْلَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN NASEERIM MAA ASLAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) helpfulness! How peaceable He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ سَلِيْمٍ مَا اَشْفَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SALAAMIM MAA ASHFAAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) peaceableness! How able He as a healer! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ شَافٍ مَّا اَنْجَاهُ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SHAAFIM MAA ANJAAHO\nGlory be to He in (His) ability to heal! How able He is as a deliver! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُّنْجٍ مَّا اَبَرَّهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MUNJIM MAA ABARRAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) ability to deliver! How innocent He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ بَآرٍّ مَّا اَطْلَبَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN BAARRIM MAA ATLABAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) innocence! How deamandant He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ طَالِبٍ مَّا اَدْرَكَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN TAALEBIM MAA ADRAKAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) demand! How perceptive He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُّدْرِكٍ مَّا اَشَدَّهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MUDREKIM MAA ARSHADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) perceptiveness! How reasonable He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ شَدِیْدٍ مَا اَعْطَفَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN RASHEEDIM MAA A-A’TAFAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) reasonableness! How affectionate He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُتَعَطِّفٍ مَّا اَعْدَلَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MOTA-A’TTEFIM MAA A-A’DALAHU\nGlory be to He in (His) affectionateness! How prudent He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ عَدْلٍ مَّا اَتْقَنَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN A’DLIM MAA ATQANAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) prudence! How perfect He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ مُتْقِنٍ مَّا اَحْكَمَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN MUTQOMIN MAA AHKAMAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) perfection! How wise He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ حَكِیْمٍ مَّا اَكْفَلَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN HAKEEMIM MAAA-AKFALAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) wisdom! How able He is to stand security! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ كَفِیْلٍ مَّا اَشْھَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN KAFEELIM MAAA ASH-HADAHU \nGlory be to He in (His) ability to stand security! How able He is!\nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ مِنْ شَھِیْدٍ مَّا اَحْمَدَهٗ \nWA SUBHAANAHU MIN SHAHEEDIM MAAA AHMADAHU \nGlory be to He to give witness! How most praiseworthy He is! \nوَ سُبْحَانَهٗ ھُوَ اللّٰهُ الْعَظِیْمُ وَ بِحَمْدِهٖ \nWA SUBHAANAHU HOWAL LAAHUL A’ZEEMO WA BE HAMDEHI \nGlory be to He! He is Allah the Supreme and (all) praise be to Him. \nوَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ وَ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَ اللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ وَ لِلّٰهِ الْحَمْدُ \nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHE WA LAA ELAAHA ILLALLAAHO WALLAAHO AKBAR, WA LILLAAHIL HAMDO \nAnd (all) praise be to Allah. There is no god except Allah, and Allah is Great and for Allah is Praise.\nوَ لَا حَوْلَ وَ لَا قُوَّۃَ اِلَّا بِاللّٰهِ الْعَلِیِّ الْعَظِیْمِ \nWA LAA HAWLA WALAA QUWWATA ILLAA BILLAAHIL A’LIYYIL A’ZEEM, \nThere is no power, and no might, except (with) Allah, the Highest High. \nدَافِعَ كُلِّ بَلِیَّۃٍ \nDAAFE-A’ KULLE BALIYYATIN \nDisperser of all calamities. \nوَّ ھُوَ حَسْبِیْ وَ نِعْمَ الْوَكِیْلُ.\nWA HOWA HASBEE WA NE-A’MAL WAKEEL.\nSufficient is He, and the Best Supporter."
